### Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Akhilesh", "email": "akhil@example.com", "password": "secret123", "phone": "9999999999"}

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@shopnest.com", "password": "admin123"}

### Create category (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Electronics", "description": "Phones, laptops and accessories"}

### Create product (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Wireless Mouse", "description": "2.4GHz mouse", "price": 799.00, "stock": 50, "categoryId": 1}

### List products
GET http://localhost:8080/products?page=0&size=10&sortBy=price&direction=asc

### Search
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?query=mouse

### Add to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### Checkout
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shippingAddress": "Flat 12, Madhapur, Hyderabad 500081", "gateway": "RAZORPAY"}

### My orders
GET http://localhost:8080/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
